  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "12579508",
      "title": "Adding Ingredient Controls to a Form Array",
      "lectureOrder": 555,
      "videoOrder": 509,
      "sourceHash": "4f7145cb84c295ebb0e674aa9be77ffca418237913f0b39edfdbeaede7b62704",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.16,
          "end": 4.83,
          "en": "-: So let's work on our ingredients list.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.83,
          "end": 6.39,
          "en": "The base form is working",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.39,
          "end": 8.43,
          "en": "but of course, we got another control",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.43,
          "end": 10.35,
          "en": "which we haven't added yet.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 10.35,
          "end": 12.603,
          "en": "This is this array of ingredients.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 13.68,
          "end": 16.95,
          "en": "So when we initialize the form, we actually",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 16.95,
          "end": 21.95,
          "en": "will have one-hour default value for the recipe ingredients.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 22.38,
          "end": 26.91,
          "en": "This will be a new Form Array",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 26.91,
          "end": 30.483,
          "en": "and you should import form array from @angler/forms.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 31.98,
          "end": 34.47,
          "en": "This form array is initialized",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 34.47,
          "end": 36.69,
          "en": "with a default value of an empty array",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 36.69,
          "end": 39.543,
          "en": "because we don't have any ingredients by default.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 40.89,
          "end": 44.43,
          "en": "Now with this, if that is our default",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 44.43,
          "end": 47.193,
          "en": "what do we override it to here in edit mode?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 48.42,
          "end": 50.76,
          "en": "Well, there we will simply need to check",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 50.76,
          "end": 53.52,
          "en": "if we have any ingredients to begin with because",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 53.52,
          "end": 57.513,
          "en": "theoretically you could create a recipe without ingredients.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 58.62,
          "end": 62.31,
          "en": "So here what I want to do is I want to check",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 62.31,
          "end": 67.31,
          "en": "if my recipe, which I loaded, if it does have ingredients.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 69.24,
          "end": 74.24,
          "en": "So if that is defined, I know I can safely use them.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 76.11,
          "end": 79.53,
          "en": "So in this case, I want to use all the ingredients",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 79.53,
          "end": 84.48,
          "en": "so I can simply loop through them with a for of loop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 84.48,
          "end": 87.43,
          "en": "So for, a single ingredient",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 88.44,
          "end": 92.82300000000001,
          "en": "of my ingredients.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 93.87,
          "end": 97.44,
          "en": "I can go through all of them and I can push them",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 97.44,
          "end": 100.11,
          "en": "onto my recipe ingredients form array,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 100.11,
          "end": 102.09,
          "en": "which has a push method.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 102.09,
          "end": 105,
          "en": "Here, I don't push the ingredient.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 105,
          "end": 109.62,
          "en": "I push a new form group instead because, I do have",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 109.62,
          "end": 113.91,
          "en": "two controls which will control a single ingredient",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 113.91,
          "end": 115.68,
          "en": "the name and the amount.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 115.68,
          "end": 118.41,
          "en": "So these will be grouped in a form group.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 118.41,
          "end": 123.41,
          "en": "And here I will have a name, which is now a new form control",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 123.84,
          "end": 128.7,
          "en": "with a default value of ingredient name.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 128.7,
          "end": 133.23,
          "en": "And I will have an amount control all the new form control",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 133.23,
          "end": 136.2,
          "en": "which has default value, ingredient amount,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 136.2,
          "end": 138.36,
          "en": "whoops not name, amount.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 138.36,
          "end": 139.95,
          "en": "So that is a form group.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 139.95,
          "end": 143.22,
          "en": "I will push onto this array because again",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 143.22,
          "end": 145.07999999999998,
          "en": "we have two controls here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 145.07999999999998,
          "end": 147.72,
          "en": "Validation will follow later.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 147.72,
          "end": 149.46,
          "en": "And with that, we got a default value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 149.46,
          "end": 150.69,
          "en": "for recipe ingredients.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 150.69,
          "end": 155.69,
          "en": "If we have a recipe, and if this recipe then has ingredients",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 155.79,
          "end": 160.79,
          "en": "with that, we can assign the ingredients control down there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 161.52,
          "end": 164.46,
          "en": "And it simply is our recipe ingredients, which already",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 164.46,
          "end": 167.46,
          "en": "is this new form array here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 167.46,
          "end": 169.56,
          "en": "So that's looking all right.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 169.56,
          "end": 171.42000000000002,
          "en": "Let's see if it works and forward it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 171.42000000000002,
          "end": 174.36,
          "en": "Of course, we need to synchronize our array",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 174.36,
          "end": 176.52,
          "en": "with our HTML code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 176.52,
          "end": 178.71,
          "en": "So in the recipe edit component, if we scroll",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 178.71,
          "end": 182.13,
          "en": "down to that section where we want to use the array",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 182.13,
          "end": 184.08,
          "en": "I'll first work on the div",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 184.08,
          "end": 187.53,
          "en": "which wraps the whole section we're going to use.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 187.53,
          "end": 192.12,
          "en": "Here I need to add the form array name directive.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 192.12,
          "end": 195.09,
          "en": "This will then be bound to ingredients",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 195.09,
          "end": 197.61,
          "en": "because ingredients keep in mind is the name",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 197.61,
          "end": 199.53,
          "en": "of our form array here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 199.53,
          "end": 200.64,
          "en": "So data signs that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 200.64,
          "end": 204.363,
          "en": "in this area we're going to handle this array of controls.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 205.23,
          "end": 207.06,
          "en": "Now each control, of course",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 207.06,
          "end": 210.3,
          "en": "is now going to be our row here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 210.3,
          "end": 215.3,
          "en": "So on this row I can place the form group name",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 215.55,
          "end": 219.57,
          "en": "directive referring to the individual form group name.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 219.57,
          "end": 224.37,
          "en": "Because remember, in our array we will have form groups",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 224.37,
          "end": 226.71,
          "en": "as each pair of name",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 226.71,
          "end": 230.43,
          "en": "and amount control creates a form group.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 230.43,
          "end": 232.2,
          "en": "Now what's the name of the form group",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 232.2,
          "end": 235.44299999999998,
          "en": "though we didn't assign it because it's part of the array?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 236.34,
          "end": 239.34,
          "en": "Well, we learned how to get this name.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 239.34,
          "end": 243.12,
          "en": "We need to add NGfor to this div.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 243.12,
          "end": 246.66,
          "en": "And then we can loop through all the ingredients",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 246.66,
          "end": 250.26,
          "en": "through all the controls, I should say, in our array.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 250.26,
          "end": 252.15,
          "en": "So I can loop through",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 252.15,
          "end": 254.873,
          "en": "the ingredient control",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 254.873,
          "end": 258.15,
          "en": "of my recipe form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 258.15,
          "end": 261.9,
          "en": "And there get the ingredients control",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 261.9,
          "end": 264.57,
          "en": "get is a method which gives us access to that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 264.57,
          "end": 266.883,
          "en": "And here all the controls of this control.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 267.78,
          "end": 270.06,
          "en": "So this gives us access to all the controls.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 270.06,
          "end": 272.15999999999997,
          "en": "And the individual control is now saved",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 272.15999999999997,
          "end": 274.56,
          "en": "in the ingredient control property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 274.56,
          "end": 277.29,
          "en": "or variable we can use in a template.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 277.29,
          "end": 282.29,
          "en": "And I can also extract the index of the current iteration",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 282.54,
          "end": 285.51,
          "en": "which will be the name for my form group.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 285.51,
          "end": 289.14300000000003,
          "en": "So with property binding, I can now bind, I, here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 290.19,
          "end": 292.62,
          "en": "This should give me the form group.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 292.62,
          "end": 295.74,
          "en": "Now we also need to populate these inputs.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 295.74,
          "end": 297.33,
          "en": "And there it's very easy",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 297.33,
          "end": 299.82,
          "en": "because now we're inside the form group.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 299.82,
          "end": 301.38,
          "en": "And there we have names.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 301.38,
          "end": 303.03,
          "en": "We have name and amount.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 303.03,
          "end": 305.303,
          "en": "So here we can again use form control name",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 305.303,
          "end": 308.61,
          "en": "that is equal to name for the first control",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 308.61,
          "end": 312.513,
          "en": "and form control name equal to amount for the second one.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 313.5,
          "end": 316.71,
          "en": "Let's see if that works as expected.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 316.71,
          "end": 318.87,
          "en": "Well, it already looks pretty good to me here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 318.87,
          "end": 322.86,
          "en": "We got buns and meat, and if we added the schnitzel",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 322.86,
          "end": 324.78,
          "en": "we get meat and french fries.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 324.78,
          "end": 326.91,
          "en": "So that gets populated correctly.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 326.91,
          "end": 328.77,
          "en": "This is working as intended.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 328.77,
          "end": 331.26,
          "en": "With that, we got our array added.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 331.26,
          "end": 333.75,
          "en": "Now of course, we also need to add a way",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 333.75,
          "end": 336.813,
          "en": "for us to dynamically add new items to that.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
